0017: asynchronous GetRenderTargetData for callers that can wait a frame or two. The client exports RemixBridge_ReadRenderTargetAsync, RemixBridge_PollReadback and RemixBridge_CancelReadback (client.asyncReadback, default off). The server queues the copy with an event query behind it and moves on; once the event signals (polled every 64 commands and at Present) it locks the destination without waiting and writes the rows into one of 4 shared 256 KB slots, then publishes the request's sequence (the QuerySharedBlock handshake). The game's own GetRenderTargetData calls stay synchronous. Test: test-async-readback.cmd (test_async_readback_device).
Applies after 0001-0014 on NVIDIAGameWorks/dxvk-remix f35b86a (bridge/ only), with or without 0015-0016.
